<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>KartikRaj_R2 · Paytm Chukta</title>
<style>
@page{size:1280px 720px;margin:0}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--navy:#002E6E;--cyan:#00BAF2;--sky:#E3F5FD;--mist:#F3F7FB;--ink:#14213D;--grey:#5B6B82;--line:#D3DFEB;--green:#15A34A;--amber:#E8930C;--red:#E5484D}
body{font-family:Carlito,'DejaVu Sans','Noto Color Emoji',sans-serif;color:var(--ink);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.27;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact}
.e{font-family:'Noto Color Emoji';font-style:normal}
b,strong{font-weight:700}
.slide{width:1280px;height:720px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;page-break-after:always;background:#fff}
.topbar{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:7px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--navy) 0 80%,var(--cyan) 80% 100%)}
.hdr{position:absolute;top:15px;left:34px;right:34px;height:66px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy)}
.hdr h1{font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.1;max-width:1000px}
.hdr .sub{font-size:14.5px;color:#334766;margin-top:4px;font-style:italic;max-width:1010px}
.brand{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;text-align:right;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);line-height:1}
.brand span{color:var(--cyan)}
.brand small{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--grey);font-weight:400;margin-top:4px}
.body{position:absolute;top:90px;left:34px;right:34px;bottom:42px}
.foot{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:34px;right:34px;height:32px;border-top:1px solid #C3D2E2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7A90}
.foot .on{color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;box-shadow:inset 0 3px 0 var(--cyan);padding-top:6px;margin-top:-6px}
.pg{margin-left:auto;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;min-width:30px;height:23px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 6px}
.bar{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:4px 9px;letter-spacing:.2px}
.bar.c{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.bar.l{background:var(--sky);color:var(--navy)}
.bar.ctr{text-align:center}
.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
.mist{background:var(--mist)}
.sky{background:var(--sky)}
.pad{padding:7px 9px}
.g{display:grid;gap:10px}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px}
.k{font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.cy{color:#0089B8}
.muted{color:var(--grey)}
.small{font-size:11px}
.xs{font-size:10px}
.it{font-style:italic}
.big{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);line-height:1}
.med{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);line-height:1}
ul.t{list-style:none}
ul.t li{position:relative;padding-left:13px;margin:2px 0}
ul.t li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:6px;width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%}
ul.ck li:before{content:"✓";background:none;color:var(--green);font-weight:700;top:0;left:0}
ul.x li:before{content:"!";background:none;color:var(--red);font-weight:700;top:0;left:2px}
table.tb{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.8px}
table.tb th{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;font-weight:700;vertical-align:bottom}
table.tb td{padding:3.5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #E1E9F2;vertical-align:top}
table.tb tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F8FBFD}
table.opt td{padding:4.6px 6px}
.rice td{padding:2.5px 6px}
#samp td{padding:2.5px 6px}
#trace td{padding:2.6px 6px}
table.tb tr.hl td{background:var(--sky);font-weight:700}
.num{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
.ctr{text-align:center}
.tbd{display:inline-block;border:1.5px dashed var(--amber);background:#FFF5E1;height:14px;vertical-align:-2px;border-radius:2px}
.chip{display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--sky);color:var(--navy);white-space:nowrap}
.chip.g{background:#DDF5E6;color:#0F7A37}.chip.a{background:#FFF0D6;color:#9A5B00}.chip.r{background:#FDE3E4;color:#B4232A}.chip.n{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.quote{background:#fff;border-left:4px solid var(--cyan);padding:5px 8px;font-style:italic;font-size:12px}
.quote small{display:block;font-style:normal;color:var(--grey);font-size:10.5px;margin-top:2px}
.say{position:relative;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12.5px}
.say:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:22px;bottom:-8px;border:8px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--navy);border-bottom:0}
.hb{display:inline-block;width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;border:1.6px solid var(--navy);vertical-align:-3px}
.h0{background:#fff}.h1{background:conic-gradient(var(--navy) 0 25%,#fff 0)}.h2{background:conic-gradient(var(--navy) 0 50%,#fff 0)}.h3{background:conic-gradient(var(--navy) 0 75%,#fff 0)}.h4{background:var(--navy)}
.step{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-start}
.stepn{flex:none;width:21px;height:21px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px}
.stepn.c{background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy)}
.stat{padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
.stat .big{font-size:26px}
.arrowR{width:0;height:0;border-top:9px solid transparent;border-bottom:9px solid transparent;border-left:11px solid var(--cyan)}
.lrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 1fr 200px;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin:4px 0}
.lcode{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;text-align:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px;padding:2px 0}
.lbar{height:20px;background:#EAF1F7;position:relative;font-size:11.5px;display:flex;align-items:center}
.lbar div{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:var(--cyan)}
.lbar b{position:relative;padding-left:5px;color:var(--navy)}
.lbar.empty{border:1px dashed #C4D3E2;background:#fff;padding-left:6px;gap:4px}
/* phone mockups */
.phone{width:196px;height:378px;border:7px solid #10213D;border-radius:26px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,46,110,.18)}
.phone .notch{height:16px;background:#10213D;width:70px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px}
.scr{padding:5px 8px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.22}
.appbar{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:5px 8px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.appbar span{color:var(--cyan)}
.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:5px 6px;margin:4px 0;background:#fff}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--cyan);color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 7px;font-size:10px}
.btn.o{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy)}
.btn.n{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;margin:4px 0}.tabs span{font-size:9.5px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:9px;background:#EEF3F8}.tabs span.on{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.phone img.shot{display:block;width:100%;height:calc(100% - 16px);object-fit:cover;object-position:top}
.ann{position:absolute;background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #F1C66E;font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;width:150px;line-height:1.2}
</style></head><body>

{% set NAV = ['Summary','Problem & insight','Validation','Design & feasibility','GTM & pilot','Business impact','Annexure'] %}
{% macro foot(active, n) -%}
<div class="foot">{% for s in NAV %}<span class="{{ 'on' if s==active else '' }}">{{ s }}</span>{% endfor %}<span class="pg">{{ n }}</span></div>
{%- endmacro %}
{% macro hdr(title, sub) -%}
<div class="topbar"></div>
<div class="hdr"><h1>{{ title }}</h1><div class="sub">{{ sub }}</div>
<div class="brand">Paytm <span>Chukta</span><small>Track B · Kartik Raj</small></div></div>
{%- endmacro %}
{% set y1, y2, y3 = M.years[0], M.years[1], M.years[2] %}

<!-- ===================== COVER ===================== -->
<div class="slide" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff 0 58.5%,var(--navy) 58.5% 100%)">
  <div class="topbar"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute;left:60px;top:58px;width:640px">
    <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0089B8;letter-spacing:1px">PAYTM INNOVATION CHALLENGE 2026 · ROUND 2 · FINAL SUBMISSION</div>
    <div style="font-size:78px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);line-height:1;margin-top:26px">Paytm <span style="color:var(--cyan)">Chukta</span></div>
    <div style="font-size:16px;color:var(--grey);margin-top:6px"><i>"hisaab chukta"</i> = the account is settled</div>
    <div style="font-size:24px;color:var(--ink);margin-top:26px;line-height:1.25">Paisa Paytm pe aata hai.<br><b style="color:var(--navy)">Ab supplier ka bill bhi Paytm se chukta.</b></div>
    <div style="font-size:15px;color:var(--grey);margin-top:8px">Money already comes in on Paytm. Now the shop's stock bills go out on Paytm too.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <span class="chip n" style="font-size:12.5px;padding:4px 10px">Track B · Merchants as UPI payers</span>
      <span class="chip" style="font-size:12.5px;padding:4px 10px">Segment: owners of stock-buying shops on Paytm Soundbox / QR</span>
      <span class="chip" style="font-size:12.5px;padding:4px 10px">Pilot city: Kanpur</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:30px;border-top:2px solid var(--navy);padding-top:10px;font-size:15px">
      <b style="color:var(--navy);font-size:19px">Kartik Raj</b> · Individual entry<br>
      <span class="muted">B.Tech, IIT Kanpur · Field research in Kanpur, Sep–Oct 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Soundbox illustration -->
  <div style="position:absolute;left:790px;top:80px;width:440px">
    <div class="say" style="background:#fff;color:var(--navy);font-size:17px;padding:12px 16px;line-height:1.3"><span class="e">🔊</span> <i>"Aaj ₹31,420 aaye.<br>Kal Sharma Traders ke ₹12,400 dene hain."</i>
      <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--grey);font-style:normal;margin-top:4px">Paytm Soundbox · 9:00 pm closing summary</div></div>
    <svg width="440" height="330" viewBox="0 0 440 330" style="margin-top:14px">
      <defs><linearGradient id="sb" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#1B4E96"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#001F4D"/></linearGradient></defs>
      <rect x="120" y="40" width="190" height="230" rx="38" fill="url(#sb)" stroke="#00BAF2" stroke-width="3"/>
      {% for r in range(6) %}{% for c in range(6) %}<circle cx="{{ 160 + c*22 }}" cy="{{ 85 + r*22 }}" r="5" fill="#00BAF2" opacity="{{ 0.35 + 0.1*((r+c)%4) }}"/>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
      <rect x="150" y="225" width="130" height="26" rx="6" fill="#0A2A5C" stroke="#00BAF2"/>
      <text x="215" y="243" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="13" font-weight="700">paytm ₹ chukta</text>
      <path d="M40 120 C 80 120, 90 150, 118 150" stroke="#00BAF2" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/>
      <polygon points="118,142 132,150 118,158" fill="#00BAF2"/>
      <text x="8" y="105" fill="#fff" font-size="14" font-weight="700">MONEY IN</text>
      <text x="8" y="122" fill="#BFE9FA" font-size="12">customers, all day</text>
      <path d="M312 160 C 345 160, 350 200, 395 200" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="9 6"/>
      <polygon points="395,192 410,200 395,208" fill="#fff"/>
      <text x="318" y="228" fill="#fff" font-size="14" font-weight="700">MONEY OUT</text>
      <text x="318" y="245" fill="#BFE9FA" font-size="12">stock bills, now on Paytm</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div style="position:absolute;left:790px;bottom:30px;color:#BFE9FA;font-size:12px;width:440px">Files: KartikRaj_R2.pdf · KartikRaj_R2_Annexure.xlsx<br>Round 1 evidence: KartikRaj_VOC.xlsx (50 VOCs)</div>
  <div style="position:absolute;left:60px;bottom:40px;width:640px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px">
    <div class="stat"><div class="med">50</div><div class="small">VOCs in Round 1 (10 in-depth)</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="med">{{ v('merchants_tested') }}+{{ v('distributors_tested') }}</div><div class="small">shop owners + distributors interviewed in Round 2</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="med">20</div><div class="small">distributors in a randomised 90-day pilot</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="med">₹0</div><div class="small">cashback in the growth model</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===================== 1 EXEC SUMMARY ===================== -->
<div class="slide">
{{ hdr('Executive summary', 'Chukta turns Paytm from the app that hears a shop\'s income into the app that pays its suppliers, using bills and voice instead of cashback') }}
<div class="body">
 <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1.25fr 1fr;height:314px">
  <div class="panel chk"><div class="bar">😟 Problem (validated in R1)</div><div class="pad">
    <p><b class="k">1.57 Cr</b> merchants pay Paytm for a Soundbox / QR, yet their largest outgoing payments, <b>supplier stock bills (80% of ₹ paid out)</b>, leave through PhonePe, Google Pay or cash.</p>
    <div class="row" style="margin-top:7px"><div class="stat" style="flex:1"><div class="big">39/39</div><div class="small">Paytm-receiving shops pay suppliers elsewhere</div></div><div class="stat" style="flex:1"><div class="big">0%</div><div class="small">Paytm share of ₹52 L/mo business UPI logged</div></div></div>
    <p class="small" style="margin-top:6px">50 VOCs · 10 in-depth · 12 Kanpur areas · 9 categories · owners only</p>
    <div class="quote" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11.5px">"Paytm sirf aane ke liye hai, dena ho toh PhonePe khulta hai."<small>VOC-001 · Kirana</small></div></div></div>
  <div class="panel chk"><div class="bar">🔍 Why it happens</div><div class="pad">
    <div class="step"><span class="stepn">1</span><div><b>Wrong app in hand:</b> 32/50 pay from the owner's personal phone; 40/50 didn't know Paytm Business can pay.</div></div>
    <div class="step" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="stepn">2</span><div><b>Bills live outside:</b> paper challans, WhatsApp PDFs, memory.</div></div>
    <div class="step" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="stepn">3</span><div><b>The salesman decides:</b> whatever QR he shows wins (10/50).</div></div>
    <div class="step" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="stepn">4</span><div><b>Cash short on stock day:</b> 9/50 barrier; 32/50 want 7-day pay-later.</div></div>
    <div class="step" style="margin-top:4px"><span class="stepn c">+</span><div><b>New in 2026:</b> 0.4% MDR makes distributors push for cash / NEFT (23/50 already asked).</div></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="panel chk sky"><div class="bar c">💡 Solution: Paytm Chukta</div><div class="pad">
    <p>A <b>supplier-bill inbox</b> inside Paytm for Business <i>and</i> the Paytm app, where the shop's money already lands.</p>
    <table class="tb" style="margin-top:5px;font-size:11.5px">
     <tr><td><b>📥 Bill aata hai</b></td><td>Distributor pushes from Tally / Marg / Busy (Bharat Connect or Paytm API), owner scans the <b>signed e-invoice QR</b>, or snaps / forwards the bill</td></tr>
     <tr><td><b>🔊 Yaad dilata hai</b></td><td>Soundbox's 9 pm summary adds tomorrow's dues</td></tr>
     <tr><td><b>✅ Ek tap chukta</b></td><td>Payee verified against supplier GSTIN; invoice-tagged UPI on the rail the supplier picks</td></tr>
     <tr><td><b>⏳ 7 din baad</b></td><td>Credit line on UPI from lending partners (phase 2)</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p class="small" style="margin-top:4px"><b>Growth engine:</b> distributors get <b>Chukta Collect</b> free; their salesmen enrol their 150–400 shops.</p></div></div>
  <div class="panel chk"><div class="bar">🧪 Validation (Round 2)</div><div class="pad">
    <p>Screener → concept test → <b>stated commitment ladder</b>, in person, 8 Oct.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:5px">Interviewed <b>{{ v('merchants_tested') }}</b> shop owners + <b>{{ v('distributors_tested') }}</b> distributors in Kanpur.</p>
    <div class="stat" style="margin-top:6px"><div class="big">{{ v('l3_paid') }}<span style="font-size:16px">/{{ v('walk_n') }}</span></div><div class="small">said they'd pay their <b>next</b> supplier bill through Paytm (stated; {{ pct('concept_top2','concept_n') }} rated it 4–5)</div></div>
    <div class="stat" style="margin-top:5px"><div class="med">{{ v('d_loi') }} <span style="font-size:13px">of {{ v('distributors_tested') }} distributors</span></div><div class="small">agreed to join the 90-day pilot (verbal)</div></div>
    <p class="small" style="margin-top:5px">{{ v('einv_bills') }} of {{ v('bills_seen') }} shops get bills with an e-invoice QR. Usability and real payments are tested in pilot weeks 1–2.</p>
  </div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1.6fr 1fr;margin-top:10px;height:250px">
  <div class="panel chk"><div class="bar">🧭 90-day Kanpur pilot</div><div class="pad">
   <ul class="t">
    <li><b>20 distributors</b> (FMCG + pharma), cluster-randomised <b>10 treat / 10 control</b>, ~2,500 retailers per arm</li>
    <li><b>Baseline</b> = 4 weeks of distributor ledgers (who paid which invoice, by which mode): the only true denominator</li>
    <li><b>Scale if</b> Paytm share of treated shops' supplier ₹ is <b>≥ +25 pp vs control</b> and ≥ 60% of activated shops repeat ≥ 3 bills/month</li>
    <li><b>Stop if</b> &lt; +10 pp or activation &lt; 15%. Budget ≈ ₹10 L</li>
   </ul></div></div>
  <div class="panel chk"><div class="bar">📈 Business impact (national roll-out, no cashback)</div><div class="pad" style="padding-top:5px">
   <table class="tb" style="font-size:11.2px">
    <tr><th>Metric</th><th class="num">Today</th><th class="num">Year 1</th><th class="num">Year 2</th><th class="num">Year 3</th></tr>
    <tr class="hl"><td>Paytm share of segment's supplier UPI <i>(main metric)</i></td><td class="num">~8%</td><td class="num">{{ '%.1f'|format(y1.seg_share*100) }}%</td><td class="num">{{ '%.1f'|format(y2.seg_share*100) }}%</td><td class="num">{{ '%.1f'|format(y3.seg_share*100) }}%</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Active Chukta merchants (new business-payer MTU)</td><td class="num">–</td><td class="num">{{ lk(y1.adopters) }}</td><td class="num">{{ lk(y2.adopters) }}</td><td class="num">{{ lk(y3.adopters) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Incremental Paytm UPI GMV / year</td><td class="num">–</td><td class="num">{{ cr(y1.gmv_y) }}</td><td class="num">{{ cr(y2.gmv_y) }}</td><td class="num">{{ cr(y3.gmv_y) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Revenue (payer + acquirer MDR, credit distribution)</td><td class="num">–</td><td class="num">{{ cr(y1.rev) }}</td><td class="num">{{ cr(y2.rev) }}</td><td class="num">{{ cr(y3.rev) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Cost per ₹1,000 of new GMV · per extra active merchant</td><td class="num">–</td><td class="num">₹{{ '%.2f'|format(y1.per_1000) }} · ₹{{ inr(y1.cost_per_active) }}</td><td class="num">₹{{ '%.2f'|format(y2.per_1000) }} · ₹{{ inr(y2.cost_per_active) }}</td><td class="num">₹{{ '%.2f'|format(y3.per_1000) }} · ₹{{ inr(y3.cost_per_active) }}</td></tr>
   </table>
   <p class="small" style="margin-top:4px">Pool: {{ lk(M.target) }} target shops × ₹60k supplier UPI/month = <b>{{ cr(M.pool_m) }}/month</b>. Year 3 adds ~{{ '%.2f'|format(y3.nat_pp) }} pp to Paytm's share of <i>all</i> UPI value from one segment.</p></div></div>
  <div class="panel chk mist"><div class="bar">🔁 What changed since Round 1</div><div class="pad small">
   <ul class="t">
    <li><b>Rail-neutral after the 15 Oct MDR:</b> supplier picks QR or bank account; MDR is upside, not the model</li>
    <li><b>Signed e-invoice QR</b> as the primary capture for ₹5 Cr+ distributors</li>
    <li>Chukta in <b>both</b> Paytm apps (32/50 pay from personal phones)</li>
    <li><b>Push-only</b> bills: no UPI collect (P2P collect ended Oct 2025)</li>
    <li>Distributor-funded early-pay discount, <b>₹0 Paytm cashback</b></li>
    <li>Forecast cut: adoption 8/20/35% (was 15/30/45%)</li>
   </ul></div></div>
 </div>
</div>
{{ foot('Summary', 1) }}
</div>

<!-- ===================== 2 R1 -> R2 ===================== -->
<div class="slide">
{{ hdr('Round 1 found a 100% "leak"; Round 2 re-tested the fix against 2026\'s new rules', 'The problem held up in every Kanpur shop we met. Seven design choices changed after checking MDR, the collect ban, device binding and field reality') }}
<div class="body">
 <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:455px 1fr;height:100%">
  <div class="g" style="grid-template-rows:auto auto 1fr">
   <div class="panel chk"><div class="bar">Recap: the money flow Paytm sees vs misses</div>
    <div class="pad" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 46px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:4px">
     <div class="sky" style="padding:6px;border:1px solid #9ADFF7"><b class="k">MONEY IN · Paytm owns</b><br>Customers pay ₹50–₹2,000 all day → <b>Soundbox / QR</b> "₹ prapt hue"</div>
     <div style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);font-size:11px">Shop's<br>bank a/c</div>
