<div class="slide">
{{ hdr('Six interventions scored: only a bill-led, distributor-seeded design wins on GMV and stickiness', 'Cashback buys transactions that stop when the money stops; awareness alone leaves the habit intact. Chukta keeps the cheap pieces as components') }}
<div class="body">
 <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 290px;height:100%">
