   </table>
   <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;padding:8px;gap:8px">
    <div class="mist pad small"><b class="k">Why not cashback?</b> A 0.1% reward on Chukta's Year 3 GMV would cost <b>{{ cr(y3.gmv_y*0.001) }} a year, every year</b>, {{ '%.1f'|format(y3.gmv_y*0.001/y3.cost) }}× Chukta's entire Year 3 cost, and PhonePe can match it overnight.</div>
    <div class="mist pad small"><b class="k">Why not credit first?</b> Credit line on UPI only works on <b>merchant (P2M) payees</b>, needs lender underwriting under RBI's 2025 digital-lending rules, and helps 9/50 shops. It is a retention feature, not the hook.</div>
    <div class="mist pad small"><b class="k">Why not ERP alone?</b> Bharat Connect reaches distributors on Tally / ERP, but the retailer still needs an app to receive and pay the bill. Chukta <b>is</b> that retailer front-end.</div>
   </div>
   <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;padding:0 8px 8px;gap:8px">
    <div class="panel pad small"><b class="k">Robustness check on the weights</b>
     <table class="tb" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:11.3px"><tr><th>Scoring rule</th><th class="num">Cashback</th><th class="num">Awareness</th><th class="num">Voice</th><th class="num">Credit</th><th class="num">ERP</th><th class="num">Chukta</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Equal weights</td><td class="num">12</td><td class="num">15</td><td class="num">16</td><td class="num">11</td><td class="num">16</td><td class="num"><b>21</b></td></tr>
      <tr><td>GMV uplift × 2</td><td class="num">15</td><td class="num">16</td><td class="num">17</td><td class="num">14</td><td class="num">18</td><td class="num"><b>25</b></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Speed to pilot × 2</td><td class="num">16</td><td class="num">19</td><td class="num">20</td><td class="num">12</td><td class="num">18</td><td class="num"><b>24</b></td></tr>
     </table><div class="xs muted" style="margin-top:2px">Chukta ranks first under every weighting tested.</div></div>
    <div class="panel pad small sky"><b class="k">How the pieces combine</b><div style="margin-top:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)">
      <span class="chip">🔗 ERP push</span>+<span class="chip">📷 QR / photo</span>→<span class="chip n">📥 Bill inbox</span>→<span class="chip">🔊 Voice nudge</span>→<span class="chip n">✅ Pay</span>→<span class="chip">⏳ Credit (ph. 2)</span></div>
     <div style="margin-top:5px">Awareness messaging launches it; the distributor's salesman distributes it. Cashback is the only option dropped outright.</div></div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel chk sky"><div class="bar c">Design principles we kept</div><div class="pad">
   {% set DP = [('📍','Put the bill where the money lands','Inflow and outflow in one place is the only position competitors can\'t copy quickly.'),
     ('🤝','Let the distributor recruit','One signed distributor brings 150–400 shops; the salesman already visits weekly.'),
     ('🚫','Never pay for a transaction','₹0 Paytm cashback. Any discount is the distributor\'s own early-pay scheme.'),
     ('⚖️','Be rail-neutral','Supplier picks QR or bank account; GMV counts on Paytm either way; MDR is upside.'),
     ('🔐','Trust before speed','Payee name checked against supplier GSTIN; push-only, never collect.'),
     ('⏳','Credit is a feature, not the hook','Launch after payment habit forms; lender carries the risk.')] %}
   {% for ic,t,d in DP %}<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px 1fr;gap:4px;margin-bottom:7px"><span class="e" style="font-size:18px">{{ ic }}</span><div><b>{{ t }}</b><div class="small">{{ d }}</div></div></div>{% endfor %}
  </div></div>
 </div>
</div>
{{ foot('Problem & insight', 5) }}
</div>

