   <tr><td>Rated "bills inside Paytm, 1 tap" 4–5 / 5</td><td class="num">41</td><td>Stated demand is high</td><td>Whole loop</td><td>Treated-shop share ≥ 35%</td></tr>
   <tr><td>Would use 7-day pay-later</td><td class="num">32</td><td>Credit is wanted but secondary</td><td>Phase-2 credit</td><td>Credit sub-cohort uptake</td></tr>
  </table></div>
 <div class="g" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:8px;gap:8px">
  <div class="stat small" style="padding:5px 8px"><b class="k">📒 Workbook:</b> KartikRaj_R2_Annexure.xlsx (logs, dashboard, model, sensitivity, pilot, risks, sources)</div>
  <div class="stat small" style="padding:5px 8px"><b class="k">📱 Prototype (live):</b> merchant app + Chukta Collect: <span style="color:#0089B8">{{ v('proto_link') }}</span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="panel chk" style="margin-top:8px"><div class="bar">📊 Feature prioritisation (RICE = Reach × Impact × Confidence ÷ Effort; analyst judgement from VOC counts)</div>
  {% set RICE = [
   ('🔊 Soundbox "due tomorrow" line',78,2,0.7,2,'MVP','39/50 receive on a Paytm device'),
   ('🔐 Payee check (GSTIN ↔ VPA name)',96,2,0.7,3,'MVP','Trust + fraud guard on every bill'),
   ('📱 Chukta in the Paytm app too',64,3,0.8,4,'MVP','32/50 pay from personal phone'),
   ('📥 Bill inbox + due-date engine',96,3,0.8,8,'MVP','48/50 pay suppliers; the core'),
   ('📷 Photo / PDF bill read',90,2,0.6,6,'MVP','Most bills are paper'),
   ('🔳 e-invoice QR capture',40,2,0.6,3,'MVP','Distributors above ₹5 Cr turnover'),
   ('🚚 Chukta Collect (distributor)',20,3,0.6,6,'MVP*','*Low shop reach, but it is the growth channel'),
   ('⏳ 7 din baad (credit)',64,2,0.4,16,'Phase 2','32/50 want it; lender-dependent'),
   ('🔗 ERP / Bharat Connect push',40,2,0.5,14,'Phase 2','CSV upload in the pilot'),
   ('🧾 GST purchase register',4,1,0.6,2,'Phase 2','2/50 raised records')
  ] %}
  <table class="tb rice" style="font-size:10.9px"><tr><th>Feature</th><th class="num">Reach %</th><th class="num">Impact (1–3)</th><th class="num">Confidence</th><th class="num">Effort (wks)</th><th class="num">RICE</th><th>Release</th><th>Why</th></tr>
   {% for f,r,i,c,e,rel,why in RICE %}<tr><td>{{ f }}</td><td class="num">{{ r }}</td><td class="num">{{ i }}</td><td class="num">{{ (c*100)|int }}%</td><td class="num">{{ e }}</td><td class="num"><b>{{ '%.1f'|format(r*i*c/e) }}</b></td><td><span class="chip {{ 'g' if 'MVP' in rel else 'a' }}">{{ rel }}</span></td><td class="small">{{ why }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </table></div>
</div>
{{ foot('Annexure', 'A3') }}
</div>
